  <string id="about_title">ABOUT</string>
  <string id="about_h_game">THE GAME</string>
  <string id="about_name">KATANA-PUNK</string>
  <string id="about_genre">Genre: action roguelike, top-down view.</string>
  <string id="about_summary">Summary: the protagonist fights a large corporation and waves of its employees, upgrading stats, katana and gun.</string>
  <string id="about_h_loop">GAMEPLAY LOOP</string>
  <string id="about_loop">Core loop: kill enemies to upgrade the katana or the firearm, at the player's choice. Clearing a floor grants one upgrade; enemy XP raises HP, speed and damage. Comparable titles: Vampire Survivors, Hotline Miami, DOOM. There are 40 floors. After clearing floor 40 the player plants a bomb in the center, escapes out the window with a parachute, and the evil corporation tower explodes.</string>
  <string id="about_h_controls">CONTROLS AND RESOURCES</string>
  <string id="about_controls">Controls: move, katana attack, gunshots (pistol, shotgun, minigun).</string>
  <string id="about_resources">Resources: ammo and XP drop from enemies and are collected automatically.</string>
  <string id="about_h_team">TEAM</string>
  <string id="about_team">Made by:
- Artur Salyakhutdinov - sprites, characters
- Makar Guryanov - code
- Pyotr Struin - sprites, sound effects, scenery
- Aust Alexander - code, sprites, music</string>
